window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From a <i>New York Times</i> and <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author comes a new kind of textbook.... </p> <p>Do you want to master German? Do you like urban fantasy novels? Are you tired of reading boring textbooks in order to learn German? </p> <p>If you answered yes to one or more of these questions, this is a book you should consider. We introduce a one-of-a-kind learning tool that will enhance your comprehension, improve your German vocabulary and grammar, and let you enjoy an urban fantasy novel from a <i>New York Times</i> and <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author in the process. </p>"; 
